  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 102.73 Environmental monitoring points",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 102.73 “Environmental monitoring points” means locations, monitoring wells, gas probes, and devices for sampling air, soil, groundwater, or surface water at a facility.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Env-Sw 100) #8460-B, eff 10-28-05; renumbered by #13357 (formerly Env-Sw 102.60); ss by #14103, effective 10-23-24 (formerly Env-Sw 102.58) (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Sw 100)",
